### lys-shell Configuration - Audio Module

## Audio Module Configuration

settings-modules-audio-speaker-icons = Speaker Icons
    .description = Speaker icons for volume levels from low to maximum

settings-modules-audio-speaker-icon-muted = Speaker Muted Icon
    .description = Speaker icon shown while the output is muted

settings-modules-audio-mic-icon = Microphone Icon
    .description = Microphone icon shown while the input is live

settings-modules-audio-mic-icon-muted = Microphone Muted Icon
    .description = Microphone icon shown while the input is muted

settings-modules-audio-mic-hide-when-idle = Hide Microphone When Idle
    .description = Show the microphone icon only while an app records the microphone

settings-modules-audio-capture-camera-icon = Camera Icon
    .description = Icon shown while an app holds a camera open

settings-modules-audio-capture-screen-icon = Screen Icon
    .description = Icon shown while an app shares the screen

settings-modules-audio-capture-color = Capture Color
    .description = Color of the microphone icon while an app records it, and of the camera and screen icons

settings-modules-audio-border-show = Show Border
    .description = Display border around button

settings-modules-audio-border-color = Border Color
    .description = Border color token

settings-modules-audio-icon-show = Show Icon
    .description = Display the speaker icon

settings-modules-audio-tooltip = Show Tooltip
    .description = Show the module's state in a tooltip on hover

settings-modules-audio-icon-color = Icon Color
    .description = Icon foreground color

settings-modules-audio-icon-bg-color = Icon Background
    .description = Icon container background color

settings-modules-audio-label-show = Show Label
    .description = Display the label

settings-modules-audio-label-color = Label Color
    .description = Label text color

settings-modules-audio-format = Format
    .description = Label template (e.g. {"{{"} percent {"}}"} %)

settings-modules-audio-label-max-length = Label Max Length
    .description = Max characters before truncation

settings-modules-audio-button-bg-color = Button Background
    .description = Button background color

settings-modules-audio-left-click = Left Click
    .description = Action on left click

settings-modules-audio-right-click = Right Click
    .description = Action on right click

settings-modules-audio-middle-click = Middle Click
    .description = Action on middle click

settings-modules-audio-scroll-up = Scroll Up
    .description = Action on scroll up

settings-modules-audio-scroll-down = Scroll Down
    .description = Action on scroll down

settings-modules-audio-dropdown-app-icons = App Icons in Dropdown
    .description = Show application icons in the audio dropdown

settings-modules-audio-thresholds = Thresholds
    .description = Color thresholds that change with the speaker volume

## AppIconSource variants
enum-app-icon-source-mapped = Mapped
enum-app-icon-source-native = Native


## Format placeholders

settings-modules-audio-format-placeholder-percent = Speaker volume (0-100)
settings-modules-audio-format-placeholder-mic-percent = Microphone volume (0-100), empty without a microphone
